      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now let me check the working directory and the compile script.Now I'll write the improved test file with cleaner imports, a named constant, and grouped assertions with explanatory comments.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version removes all unused imports, introduces a `NANOS_PER_MILLI` constant to make the 1,000,000-nanosecond boundary self-documenting, and groups assertions with brief comments explaining each scenario (null/zero, sub-millisecond pass-through, exact millisecond boundary, and just-over-millisecond remainder)."
